    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{CH} _ {3} \\mathrm{OH(g)} \\xrightarrow {\\text {催化剂，} 7 0 0 ^ {\\circ} \\mathrm{C}} \\mathrm{CH} _ {2} \\mathrm{O(g)} + \\mathrm{H} _ {2} (\\mathrm{g})\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\nH _ {m} ^ {\\ominus} = 8 4. 2 \\mathrm{kJ} \\mathrm{mol} ^ {- 1}\\tag{1}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "向体系中通⼊空⽓，通过以下反应提供反应(1)所需热量："
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{H} _ {2} (\\mathrm{g}) + 0. 5 \\mathrm{O} _ {2} (\\mathrm{g}) \\rightarrow \\mathrm{H} _ {2} \\mathrm{O} (\\mathrm{g})\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "$$\nH _ {m} ^ {\\ominus} = - 2 4 1. 8 \\mathrm{kJ} \\mathrm{mol} ^ {- 1}\\tag{2}\n$$"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "要使反应温度维持在 $7 0 0 ~ ^ { \\circ } \\mathrm { C }$ ，计算进料中甲醇与空⽓的摩尔数之⽐。已知空⽓中氧⽓的体积分数为0.20。"
    }
  ]
}